Bulawayo Bakeries Limited has an authorised capital of 1,000,000 ordinary shares of US\$0.50 each. At 31 December 2025:

- 400,000 ordinary shares of US\$0.50 each had been issued, fully paid;
- 75,000 6% preference shares of US\$1 each had been issued, fully paid;
- the general reserve was US\$28,000 and retained earnings were US\$53,650 (after dividends);
- US\$80,000 of 10% debentures were in issue, repayable in 2031.

During 2025 the company paid the full preference dividend and an ordinary dividend of US\$0.04 per share.
